RadioTower_Interior1_Text_Gentleman_1::
	.string "Hi, do you want to participate in\n"
	.string "our little game?\p"
	.string "For just ¥300, you can try your\n"
	.string "luck!\p"
	.string "Get one of the colored balls and\n"
	.string "you will get a prize!\p"
	.string "How about it?\n"
	.string "Just ¥300!$"

RadioTower_Interior1_Text_Gentleman_2::
	.string "OK, if you want to play, come again!$"

RadioTower_Interior1_Text_Gentleman_3::
	.string "{PLAYER} spins the ball holder…$"

RadioTower_Interior1_Text_Gentleman_4::
	.string "Oops… Looks like you need some\n"
	.string "money…$"

RadioTower_Interior1_Text_Gentleman_5::
	.string "{PLAYER} gets a WHITE ball…$"

RadioTower_Interior1_Text_Gentleman_6::
	.string "Oh my…\n"
	.string "Seems you didn’t have luck this time!\l"
	.string "Try again!$"

RadioTower_Interior1_Text_Gentleman_7::
	.string "{PLAYER} gets a RED ball…$"

RadioTower_Interior1_Text_Gentleman_8::
	.string "We have a winner!\p"
	.string "This RED BALL means you win the\n"
	.string "prize… FULL RESTORE!$"

RadioTower_Interior1_Text_Gentleman_9::
	.string "{PLAYER} gets a BLUE ball…$"

RadioTower_Interior1_Text_Gentleman_10::
	.string "We have a winner!\p"
	.string "This BLUE BALL means you win the\n"
	.string "prize… PP UP!$"

RadioTower_Interior1_Text_Gentleman_11::
	.string "{PLAYER} gets a GREEN ball…$"

RadioTower_Interior1_Text_Gentleman_12::
	.string "We have a winner!\p"
	.string "This GREEN BALL means you win the\n"
	.string "prize… HP UP!$"

RadioTower_Interior1_Text_Gentleman_13::
	.string "{PLAYER} gets a GOLD ball…$"

RadioTower_Interior1_Text_Gentleman_14::
	.string "We have a winner!\p"
	.string "This GOLD BALL means you win the\n"
	.string "prize… MAX REVIVE!$"

RadioTower_Interior1_Text_WorkerF_1::
	.string "We have a special quiz campaign on\n"
	.string "right now.\p"
	.string "Answer five questions correctly to\n"
	.string "win a RADIO-VISIO.\p"
	.string "You’ll be able to watch a\n"
	.string "lot of TV shows.\p"
	.string "Would you like to take the quiz?$"

RadioTower_Interior1_Text_WorkerF_2::
	.string "Oh. I see. Please try if you change\n"
	.string "your mind.$"

RadioTower_Interior1_Text_WorkerF_3::
	.string "Please tune in to our RADIO-VISIO\n"
	.string "shows.$"

RadioTower_Interior1_Text_WorkerF_4::
	.string "Question 1:\p"
	.string "You need to pay for a BICYCLE?$"

RadioTower_Interior1_Text_WorkerF_5::
	.string "Oh, dear. Sorry, but you got\n"
	.string "it wrong.\l"
	.string "Please try again!$"

RadioTower_Interior1_Text_WorkerF_6::
	.string "Correct!\n"
	.string "Question 2:\p"
	.string "Can you receive CHARMANDER as a\n"
	.string "prize in GAME CORNER?$"

RadioTower_Interior1_Text_WorkerF_7::
	.string "Bull’s-eye!\n"
	.string "Question 3:\p"
	.string "Do you need the BADGE from AZALEA\n"
	.string "TOWN in order to use FLASH?$"

RadioTower_Interior1_Text_WorkerF_8::
	.string "So far so good!\n"
	.string "Question 4:\p"
	.string "What do we say to Pirates?$"

RadioTower_Interior1_Text_WorkerF_9::
	.string "Wow! Right again!\n"
	.string "Here’s the final question:\p"
	.string "You CAN catch a MUDKIP in UNION\n"
	.string "CAVE. Is this statement correct?$"

RadioTower_Interior1_Text_WorkerF_10::
	.string "Bingo! You got it!\n"
	.string "Congratulations!\p"
	.string "Here’s your prize, a RADIO-VISIO!$"

RadioTower_Interior1_Text_WorkerF_11::
	.string "{PLAYER} can now tune TV\n"
	.string "shows!\p"
	.string "Please tune in to our RADIO-VISIO\n"
	.string "shows.$"

RadioTower_Interior1_Text_Man::
	.string "I love MARY, from POKéMON TALK.\p"
	.string "I only know what she sounds like,\n"
	.string "though.$"

RadioTower_Interior1_Text_CableClubReceptionist_1::
	.string "Welcome!$"

RadioTower_Interior1_Text_CableClubReceptionist_2::
	.string "Hello. I’m sorry, but we’re not\n"
	.string "offering any tours today.$"

RadioTower_Interior1_Text_CrushGirl::
	.string "BEN is a fabulous DJ.\n"
	.string "His sweet voice makes me melt!$"

RadioTower_Interior1_Text_TeamRocketGrunt19Intro::
	.string "We’ve finally taken over the\n"
	.string "RADIO TOWER!\p"
	.string "Now everyone will get to experience\n"
	.string "the true terror of TEAM ROCKET!\p"
	.string "We’ll show you how scary we are!$"

RadioTower_Interior1_Text_TeamRocketGrunt19Defeat::
	.string "Too strong! We must watch you...$"

RadioTower_Interior1_Text_TeamRocketGrunt19::
	.string "You’re too strong.\p"
	.string "Our plan could be ruined. I must\n"
	.string "warn the others...$"

